<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 100,000 T barley, 50,000 T wheat.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 100,000 T barley, 50,000 T wheat.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia launched a tender for Tuesday for the purchase of four lots of barley of 25,000 tonnes each and two lots of soft wheat of 25,000 tonnes each, traders said on Saturday.  </p>
<p>Breakdown of shipments-</p>
<p>Barley</p>
<p>  20-31 January 1997	  25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>  10-20 February 1997	 25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>  10-20 March 1997	    25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>  10-20 April 1997	    25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Soft wheat</p>
<p>  20-31 January 1997	  25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>  20-28 February 1997	 25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
